From 5d2a9e1a89461c1b42f60979be07464e7f0ccdae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Danylo Piliaiev <dpiliaiev@igalia.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:56:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] tu: Parse driconf per physical device and pass kernel
 driver + device

Move the options to tu_physical_device, like RADV and ANV, and pass:
- kernelDriverName: "kgsl", "msm" or "virtio", for kernel_driver;
- deviceVersion: the GPU generation, for device_version_regexp;
- deviceName: the low 32 bits of the chip_id without the fuse id, like
  "0x44050a31", for device.

Add TU_DRIRC(dev, option) to improve readability.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Danylo Piliaiev <dpiliaiev@igalia.com>
