From 3a050c1ed11454a42244bb2a65f82792e588514a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Danylo Piliaiev <dpiliaiev@igalia.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 14:33:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] tu: Dirty shader consts on set bind only if shaders use
 set base addrs

Track at pipeline bind time whether the bound graphics shaders use the
base addresses and dirty the consts only in that case. Binding a graphics
pipeline already dirties the consts, and compute consts are emitted on
every dispatch, so the compute bind point doesn't need it.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Danylo Piliaiev <dpiliaiev@igalia.com>
